Use GLPK for Excel-style ranges (glpsol --ranges via PuLP/Pyomo).

Use HiGHS/CBC for fast LP/MIP (no “ranges” report).

Use Ipopt for nonlinear (Pyomo).

================
Mac
================
brew install glpk highs cbc ipopt


================
Windows
================
conda install -c conda-forge glpk coincbc ipopt highspy



================
Verify (Mac/Windows/Linux)
================

glpsol --version
highs --version
cbc --version
ipopt -v


